.env*.local

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

# generated native folders (prebuild output at the COMPANION ROOT only).
#
# Anchored with a leading slash on purpose. Unanchored, `android/` matches a
# directory of that name at ANY depth -- which silently swallowed the Kotlin
# source of the local Expo module at `modules/keepr-mms/android/`
# (BACKLOG-2973). `git add` reported success and committed nothing; the
# module would have been missing from every clone and every CI build, with
# autolinking simply not finding it. Same trap for `ios/`.
/ios/
/android/

# build output
build/
